  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The 2021-2025 Strategy (GAVI 5.0)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The 2021-2025 strategy (GAVI 5.0), which was approved by the GAVI board in june 2019, builds on the alliances years of demonstrated success and strives toward its vision to leave no one behind with immunization. to increase coverage and equity, GAVI 5.0 prioritizes zero-dose children who have not received a single vaccine shot as well as missed communities. the zero-dose agenda is also a key priority for the global communitys immunization agenda 2030, which was endorsed by the world health assembly in may 2020.</narrative>
  </description>
